Serves the circuit viewer on a host of its own (tscircuit-desktop://viewer), so the project code it runs is in another origin than the app. Requests to that host are answered with the viewer's files from the web build's tscircuit-viewer folder and with a content security policy that allows eval, which the app's own policy forbids. The app's policy is changed only to allow framing that host. The routing and the policy are in apps/desktop/src/tscircuit/circuitViewerHost.ts.

